  "student_passage": "### 示例（已解，不计入五题）\n\nHow much does the cap cost?\n\nA. Six pounds fifty.\n\nB. Eight pounds fifteen.\n\nC. Eight pounds fifty.\n\n答案：C。A：旧价不是现价；B：没有十五便士；C：现价八镑五十\n\n示例录音在材料1开头一遍，为本机示范编排；原示例精确播放次数未核，不把示例算第六道作答题。\n\n### 材料1\n\n[材料1（第1题；两遍；开头含已解示例）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-lift-gallery-extract1-v0.2.m4a)\n\n### 材料2\n\n[材料2（第2题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-lift-gallery-extract2-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料3\n\n[材料3（第3题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-lift-gallery-extract3-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料4\n\n[材料4（第4题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-lift-gallery-extract4-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料5\n\n[材料5（第5题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-lift-gallery-extract5-v0.1.m4a)",
